(6310632, 934480, 30364, '<td valign="top">Works brilliantly.  The overall effect is astonishingly convincing, but the small (and even the very small) details are sublime.  And the toning is beautifully malevolent.  Even the normally awful postbox frame serves; I feel like I''m peering at it through a slit in a bunker.  And not entirely sure that the bunker will be strong enough to endure this monster.  Top two for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Works brilliantly.  The overall effect is astonishingly convincing, but the small (and even the very small) details are sublime.  And the toning is beautifully malevolent.  Even the normally awful postbox frame serves; I feel like I''m peering at it through a slit in a bunker.  And not entirely sure that the bunker will be strong enough to endure this monster.  Top two for me.  Thank you.', '2011-02-12 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
