(6316221, 933657, 90259, '<td valign="top">My first ribbon! I''m so excited. <br/> <br/>Here''s the story behind the image: I''ve been working on a new series I call the ''Villain'' series. I''ll be taking the classic male horror movie villains, and depicting them in their natural environments, but put a pinup spin on their costumes. The pretty ladies are always the first to go in horror movies.. this time they''re the villains! I just so happened to be working on my second villain, Freddy, the week of this challenge. Perfect timing :)<br/> <br/>The rest can be seen here: <a href="//www.danimouser.com/photography/archives/744" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.danimouser.com/photography/archives/744</a> <br/> <br/>And for those who say the look is not Freddy.. in my opinion, he is the only horror movie villain who could ever get away with an evil smirk like this. All the other villains have to be so serious ;)<br/> <br/>Thanks so much for the ribbon!! :D<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-02-16 11:05:07.</i></td>', 'My first ribbon! I''m so excited.  Here''s the story behind the image: I''ve been working on a new series I call the ''Villain'' series. I''ll be taking the classic male horror movie villains, and depicting them in their natural environments, but put a pinup spin on their costumes. The pretty ladies are always the first to go in horror movies.. this time they''re the villains! I just so happened to be working on my second villain, Freddy, the week of this challenge. Perfect timing :) The rest can be seen here: //www.danimouser.com/photography/archives/744  And for those who say the look is not Freddy.. in my opinion, he is the only horror movie villain who could ever get away with an evil smirk like this. All the other villains have to be so serious ;) Thanks so much for the ribbon!! :D', '2011-02-16 01:31:20.000000', '2011-02-16 11:05:07.000000', 0),
