(6316295, 934547, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh!  I gave it a 7 at first, then knocked it back a notch when I did my next pass.  And you know what I said as I did it?  I said, "I reckon this is someone trying to look like Ben!"   So I was both smart and stupid simultaneously.  What a putz I am, sometimes.</td>', 'Oh!  I gave it a 7 at first, then knocked it back a notch when I did my next pass.  And you know what I said as I did it?  I said, "I reckon this is someone trying to look like Ben!"   So I was both smart and stupid simultaneously.  What a putz I am, sometimes.', '2011-02-16 02:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
