(6321970, 934374, 91944, '<td valign="top">I agree with SEG how did u get it to look so sharp after all that croping? i am really curious. 9</td>', 'I agree with SEG how did u get it to look so sharp after all that croping? i am really curious. 9', '2011-02-20 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
