(6326057, 933657, 90259, '<td valign="top">I"m totally bummed this was disqualified. I emailed them for clarification as to what I did wrong.. and am hoping to hear back. I checked and double-checked the editing guidelines, to make sure I was adhering to the rules, before entering it into the contest. I thought for sure I''d followed all the rules. Thank you anyways for all your nice comments. Darn :|</td>', 'I"m totally bummed this was disqualified. I emailed them for clarification as to what I did wrong.. and am hoping to hear back. I checked and double-checked the editing guidelines, to make sure I was adhering to the rules, before entering it into the contest. I thought for sure I''d followed all the rules. Thank you anyways for all your nice comments. Darn :|', '2011-02-22 00:28:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6326136, 933657, 34938, '<td valign="top">This happened to me a couple of months ago. It hurts. I picked up your ribbon for which I am grateful, but it''s not the way I like to win. So sorry. Apparently, I did the same thing as you when I was dqued.</td>', 'This happened to me a couple of months ago. It hurts. I picked up your ribbon for which I am grateful, but it''s not the way I like to win. So sorry. Apparently, I did the same thing as you when I was dqued.', '2011-02-22 03:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
