(6379652, 934047, 16912, '<td valign="top">Have been away from DPC for too long, mostly because the voters seem (to me) too shiny, shiny , thats  sharp and colourful. Just had a browse in the custom pinhole album and this jumped out at me - I like! <br/> <br/>It''s an image where I (the viewer) get to decide on what the scene is about rather than having it shoved in my face, I call that art.</td>', 'Have been away from DPC for too long, mostly because the voters seem (to me) too shiny, shiny , thats  sharp and colourful. Just had a browse in the custom pinhole album and this jumped out at me - I like!  It''s an image where I (the viewer) get to decide on what the scene is about rather than having it shoved in my face, I call that art.', '2011-04-08 19:41:15.000000', NULL, 0),
